d or append these values to the following config files to ignore this vulnerability:\n\n`/home/runner/work/fixture/fixture/osv-scanner.toml`\n\n```\n[[IgnoredVulns]]\nid = \"CVE-2026-2950\"\nreason = \"Your reason for ignoring this vulnerability\"\n```\n"
